      "side": 1,
      "message": "what about resetting this value for other charge states (such as PWR_STATE_DISCHARGE etc.). See below scenario\n\n1) At time X, chstate \u003d PWR_STATE_CHARGE and assume that batt-\u003evoltage \u003e info.voltage_min. Hence start_lowvoltage_time \u003d X\n\n2) Now assume AC is unplugged. So device goes into chstate \u003d PWR_STATE_DISCHARGE. However start_lowvoltage_time is not updated. \n\n3) After 2.5 hours reconnect AC. Now chstate \u003d PWR_STATE_CHARGE, and assume that batt-\u003evoltage \u003c info.voltage_min. Hence you will set the OEM_BATTER_STATE_ERROR even though it has not been in low voltage for 2 hours.",
